{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "73480585-a79a-52b8-9c54-b4b19dd22eb0", "source_ordinal": 1433, "reading_ordinal": 2624, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "坏得特别好", "published_at": "2024-07-27T23:18:35+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/662677164/answer/3575658818"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这个开幕式特别好，好就好在它特别不好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "法国人一贯糟糕的组织能力还遇上了少有的大雨挑战，简直是大轰炸遇上大地震。满地都是大窟窿。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "再加上开幕式内容上的惊人编排，让整个开幕式充满了令人尴尬和惊恐的细节。", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但是，说句良心话，法国人多半没想故意在这个场合去冒犯其他国家，这一点真的冤枉ta们了。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "ta们是真心的觉得这些内容是根植于人性深处、跨越文化和信仰隔阂、具有不可否认的普世性的好东西。ta们对这些东西的感染力毫不怀疑，深信只要借助勇气和艺术大胆的表达出来了，那么即使你原本比较保守、比较“内向”，在看到如此充满激情的、美好的表达之后，你也会放下原本的执着与恐惧，被本能的感动。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 288}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这个就像热情请人吃生鱼的日本老乡，ta真的不是故意要整你，ta是真的相信你只要大着胆子吃一口，你很有可能像ta一样爱吃。", "char_start": 289, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "ta不是故意要羞辱你，因为ta自己真的天天吃这个，你到日本来你不吃一口，那真的白来了，ta要替你急得跺脚。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 403}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你摆那不吃，可以，但我这桌上必须有。你不吃是你的自由，我不摆那就是我对你不够意思了。", "char_start": 404, "char_end": 446}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "难道你千里迢迢来了，我请你吃赛百味？", "char_start": 447, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "法国的自我定位，就是人类至美的先锋。", "char_start": 467, "char_end": 485}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "美国人可以掌握科技，中国人可以掌握制造，日本人可以掌握异国情调，意大利人可以掌握精致，但是法国一定要掌握人类的美学的巅峰。", "char_start": 486, "char_end": 547}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你们可能会吐槽法国人这种“脱离群众”“犯天下之大不韪”和“乱七八糟”“粗糙将就”，但从法国人自己的角度看，这却恰恰就是法国的本质。", "char_start": 548, "char_end": 613}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我们来举个例子：", "char_start": 614, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "譬如一位时装设计师，一百天后要发布新款。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 643}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "法国设计师会花90天画草图，到了第91天在名录中选几个尺码自己喜欢的model——那些身材尺寸几乎不能算正常人，然后去仓库里快速的堆一车差不多的布料，铺在模特身上直接看、直接摸，甚至自己上手染色、改色。根据自己的印象一通剪，再抄起针线拿最粗的针脚凭感觉把这些料子固定在一起，不行的地方直接上别针甚至上订书钉、热熔胶。", "char_start": 644, "char_end": 802}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "试穿之后再自己拿着剪刀别针对着模特修一次。", "char_start": 803, "char_end": 824}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "等ta搞完了，你去对着原本的草图看你都吓一跳，这个成品甚至只能说是在草稿基础上再创作的。也许可以说是神似，但形完全不似。", "char_start": 825, "char_end": 885}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "而且细节那个糙，你放到淘宝卖绝对被大规模退货，甚至模特在T台多走几圈都没准会解体、破洞。", "char_start": 886, "char_end": 930}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "在巴黎T台上秀的时装，没有带着临时别针的不多。", "char_start": 931, "char_end": 954}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "如果是中国的设计师呢？", "char_start": 956, "char_end": 967}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "第一步，先考虑标准尺码，M码和L码必须普通人穿上就好看。", "char_start": 968, "char_end": 996}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "然后选料子，必须把一件的成本控制在20块钱以下。面料贵了那拉链就不能压胶了。", "char_start": 997, "char_end": 1035}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "还要考虑这个设计压胶机好不好做、那个料子耐不耐洗。", "char_start": 1036, "char_end": 1061}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "无法大批量制造、容易出售后投诉、单价过高的设计想都不用想了，设计出来也会被老板骂得半死，早点下班不好吗？", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1114}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "于是中国设计师会花50天设计——而且这个设计很可能是根据某个工艺成熟的款式稍作创新。", "char_start": 1115, "char_end": 1157}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "然后花另外五十天尝试小批量量产，吸收产线反馈。", "char_start": 1158, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "最后发布会上穿着的是细节精致、剪裁精确、做工严谨的好货。发布会开完，直接可以接受客户下订单了，一批两万件起，我们包货柜，小批量不接。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1248}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "看出区别了吗？", "char_start": 1249, "char_end": 1256}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "巴黎时装周上那些款式根本没考虑过“批量生产”“走向大众消费市场”。", "char_start": 1257, "char_end": 1290}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "它甚至没考虑过要卖。", "char_start": 1291, "char_end": 1301}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "它的盈利逻辑是完全从另一侧考虑的——ta要的是一个最不含糊、色彩最鲜明、最有刺激性的宣言。然后作为新革命宣言的起草者，推动一系列的新的收益。", "char_start": 1302, "char_end": 1372}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "例如我推红了一款没人见过的新织物，这个织物我专利已经拿到手了，你们想要那就全都要交专利费。", "char_start": 1373, "char_end": 1418}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "例如我推红了一款个性鲜明的独特设计，你们谁不经我的批准擅自仿冒使用，也许什么穷乡僻壤我管不着，但你敢卖到欧洲美国，我肯定有办法让你吐出油水来。", "char_start": 1419, "char_end": 1490}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "问题来了，你不卖到欧洲美国，你的利润空间往往还不够养你的机器工人打版师傅的，我又跟你计较什么呢？", "char_start": 1491, "char_end": 1539}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "这是从另一侧赚钱的好生意，而且从某种意义上讲也可以算是阳谋。", "char_start": 1540, "char_end": 1570}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "这钱就该ta赚呀。", "char_start": 1571, "char_end": 1580}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "这就是“法国”。", "char_start": 1582, "char_end": 1590}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "那些准确剪裁、精致走线、规范尺码、细节工艺、售后质保……都是“次要的”，有别的国家可以去做。", "char_start": 1591, "char_end": 1637}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "只有这个不顾一切的“设计师手搓版”，只有法国能做。", "char_start": 1638, "char_end": 1663}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "以至于法国人已经形成了一个反向的思路——", "char_start": 1664, "char_end": 1684}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "如果这个原型让人觉得工艺精湛，那意味着艺术家不务正业，没有原创性，只知道拿“手艺”这种廉价的特性混好评。", "char_start": 1685, "char_end": 1737}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "如果这个原型不让人惊呼、不让人感到愤怒或者受冒犯，那意味着艺术家过于保守，为了受欢迎而背叛自己的天赋使命。", "char_start": 1738, "char_end": 1791}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "ta们就喜欢这种糙得能割破手、美得让你想掀桌的东西。", "char_start": 1792, "char_end": 1818}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "因为不割手的有日本人、意大利人做了。", "char_start": 1819, "char_end": 1837}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "不想掀桌的东西有中国人、德国人做了。", "char_start": 1838, "char_end": 1856}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "这个割手又掀桌的，只有法国人能做、敢做、愿意做而且乐于做。", "char_start": 1857, "char_end": 1886}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "所以全世界骂声一片，法国人才会满意的搓搓手——Vive La France.", "char_start": 1887, "char_end": 1925}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "ta们这样自我定位对不对呢？", "char_start": 1926, "char_end": 1940}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "对一心君临天下的中美是不行的，因为这太偏激了，注定曲高和寡、应者寥寥。", "char_start": 1941, "char_end": 1976}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "对德日肯定是不认可的，因为这太不经济、太没有效率了。", "char_start": 1977, "char_end": 2003}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "这是一个注定发不了大财、也当不了大哥，但却肯定不会饿死的自我定位。", "char_start": 2004, "char_end": 2037}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "但是呢，你会发现班上有这么一位其实又挺好的。", "char_start": 2038, "char_end": 2060}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "有ta就总有八卦和故事，大家都不寂寞、不无聊。而ta又注定没有什么威胁，谁也不用怕ta搞什么血淋淋的吓人玩意。", "char_start": 2061, "char_end": 2116}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "ta就吃这碗娱乐的饭，就肯定饿不死，而且ta这碗饭别人还真吃不了。", "char_start": 2117, "char_end": 2150}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "所以，这个开幕式非常糟糕、非常冒犯、非常粗糙，所以它才反而很法国、很好。", "char_start": 2151, "char_end": 2187}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "因为换了别的任何一个国家，都不会如此自信的玩得如此过头。于是会退回到那些“老生常谈的金碧辉煌”“八面玲珑的四平八稳”。只有法国这种“你不骂我说明我没搞到位”的专业搞创意的才能搞出点新意思来。", "char_start": 2188, "char_end": 2283}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "这样挺好，虽然糟糕，但恰恰就是这种“糟糕”，才是法国有别于其他国家的独有气质。", "char_start": 2284, "char_end": 2323}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "所以，其实在“向世界传递法兰西的文化”这方面，它反而成功了。", "char_start": 2324, "char_end": 2354}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "这就是法兰西，一个不修边幅的搞艺术的怪咖。", "char_start": 2355, "char_end": 2376}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "这其实挺好的。", "char_start": 2377, "char_end": 2384}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 63}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么看这届巴黎奥运会的开幕式？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060"], "summary": "围绕“坏得特别好”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这个开幕式特别好，好就好在它特别不好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这个开幕式特别好，好就好在它特别不好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "34b082e8-40ea-5c44-967b-1636cbe6b753", "source_ordinal": 1432, "reading_ordinal": 2625, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "两面鼓", "published_at": "2024-07-28T20:43:40+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/400968076/answer/3576436867"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "近代以前，日本社会有一个鲜明的、不同于中国的特征，那就是贫富差距极大，剥削比极高。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一名武士垄断一整个村子甚至几个村子的产量，给这些村民留下的食物少到可能会饿死人。日本农民穷到屋里地面连铺装都没有，门窗都配不齐，连名字都用不着取。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 115}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你看几个日本战国片，看看里面农家的镜头，那都是很客气的了，经常连穷得连兜裆布都是破的。", "char_start": 116, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "而那些贵人们呢？一家人吃几百上千人的血肉，搞到那些人活得跟牲口一样，自己却可以过得非常体面。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一切都要用进口唐物，起居坐卧都无比地讲究。万事都要讲一个decency。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 243}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这本身也是有政治意义的——主家与农奴的生活方式差距拉得越大，越能巩固阶级分野。轮回论和种姓制是同胞兄弟，总是形影不离。", "char_start": 244, "char_end": 303}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "其实古代日本也是种姓制的，你们没发现吗？甚至连现代的日本也一样继承着这种传统。拍个动画片，五条悟和禅院真希还是理所当然地要当绝对主角。", "char_start": 304, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这就使得“贵族运动”必须要沾染强烈的礼仪性，唯恐其器具不精、举止失范。从而使得相关的器物会有一种坚固的“原教旨主义”。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "唐朝传过来是什么样，除非天皇或者幕府将军这类贵人通过某个轶事稍微修订，否则所有人都会坚定地追求保持原样，而且要确保穷人玩不起、甚至都不知道怎么玩。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "比如，你看高尔夫球现在被认为是贵族运动，高尔夫球具就几乎没有“简易版”的。", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "马球是贵族运动，于是没人会说“大家闲了骑上生产队的驴来乐呵乐呵”——其实马球当然可以骑驴打，有啥不能？但为什么没人会去玩低配版的马球和高尔夫？因为玩了也只会受人嘲笑、损害自己的社会地位，不是吗？", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 641}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，日本的棋具是负有“贵族运动”特性加成的。便宜的棋盘棋子是有，但是被视为玩具和“贱流”，体面人不能丢这个脸。", "char_start": 642, "char_end": 698}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "日本人下棋，必须用正经的四足木棋盘，放在四平八稳的地面上，在不受打扰的净室进行。这样除非遇上地震，否则双面棋子的“劣势”就根本不存在了。", "char_start": 699, "char_end": 767}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而中国人下围棋是什么下法呢？", "char_start": 768, "char_end": 782}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "拿一张纸铺在竹床上甚至山石上，抓一把豆子都可以，砍柴的樵夫下班可以看到村里的老头在石头上玩的国民游戏。需要砍柴谋生的低级劳动者，不但会看，而且看得懂，而且会看入迷，说明啥？", "char_start": 783, "char_end": 869}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "说明围棋在中国没有日本那样的贵族属性。", "char_start": 870, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "中国的盛世，都是以轻徭薄赋、与民休息为评价标准，是以百姓富足、生活闲适为特征。可不像日本，不管啥盛世，种地的农奴都一样穷得没裤子穿，只是负责生产、随时可以斩杀的生产工具。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 975}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "在中国下围棋是随便什么下里巴人都可以玩的平民游戏，对应的，棋具棋子就大可以不必这么纠结。", "char_start": 976, "char_end": 1020}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所谓单面棋子，说穿了就是为了对应“拿一张纸甚至随手画的线当棋盘，在不一定平坦的简陋条件下下棋”的需求而生的。", "char_start": 1021, "char_end": 1075}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "老百姓出农活，中午太阳大，找棵树下混时间，根据农活进度不一定是哪块田哪棵树。棋子好带，棋盘就是一张纸或者一块布，这比麻将方便多了。", "char_start": 1076, "char_end": 1141}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "至于什么“制作工艺”，用玻璃做云子当然出现得晚，但是拿黑白陶泥搓了在板上按按烧烧还需要啥发明？", "char_start": 1142, "char_end": 1189}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "中国“流行”单面棋子，其实跟中国围棋下得没日韩这么“上进”有很大关系——因为我们一般心里没把这个看作多么贵族的东西，可不像明治维新后刚脱贫的日本“新中产阶级”，一下有钱就去玩世世代代只能仰望的贵族游戏了，那真是追星追得冒火花。", "char_start": 1190, "char_end": 1303}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "我们下围棋就是下围棋，ta们下围棋却是“live grandpa’s dream”。人家那个劲头当然比我们足得多。", "char_start": 1304, "char_end": 1361}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "韩国围棋的崛起其实也一样。", "char_start": 1362, "char_end": 1375}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "中国围棋在战后的急起直追，很大程度上也是因为日本作为发达国家推崇围棋，从而反过来让围棋在中国恢复了一些“贵族性”。", "char_start": 1376, "char_end": 1433}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "作为贵族性运动，就会讲究精致的木棋盘、专门的棋室，以及双面棋子。要好木材、好工艺、好玛瑙。", "char_start": 1434, "char_end": 1479}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "作为国民运动，就理所当然地用一张纸加两篓单面棋子——用塑料布塑料棋子都行。", "char_start": 1480, "char_end": 1517}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "但不带偏见地讲，对围棋毫无特殊精神礼拜、毫无贵族感，只是看作踢键子、滚铁环一类的庶民消遣的这个想法，的确也就很难出大国手。", "char_start": 1519, "char_end": 1580}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "因为这个仪式感、高贵感是一个非常强的精神回馈，对于一般人熬过那些艰苦的专业修行有很大的助力作用。", "char_start": 1581, "char_end": 1629}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "不过这就是另一个话题了。", "char_start": 1630, "char_end": 1642}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 31}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么在中国一面平的围棋棋子会取代两面鼓的?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030"], "summary": "围绕“两面鼓”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“近代以前，日本社会有一个鲜明的、不同于中国的特征，那就是贫富差距极大，剥削比极高。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "近代以前，日本社会有一个鲜明的、不同于中国的特征，那就是贫富差距极大，剥削比极高。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 41, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "cc63a391-fb8b-58d6-9ee2-b319b00816bd", "source_ordinal": 1431, "reading_ordinal": 2626, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "问得不耐烦", "published_at": "2024-07-29T03:13:51+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/660814129/answer/3576669957"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "说“不懂就问”，就给了发问权。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你问了，对方不耐烦、发火，原因不在于“你提了问题”这个事实本身，而在于你提的问题没提好。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 60}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这其实没有啥矛盾的。", "char_start": 61, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这主要是“不懂”的定义问题。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "很多人定义的“不懂”是自己思考了一下没想明白，于是这就叫“不懂”了，拿来问的时候就直接问自己没想明白的那个原问题。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这样当这个问题被提交上来的时候，你本人对这个问题做的若干探索完全没有任何体现，除了这个原问题本身，“你是怎么没有解开这个问题的”这个有重大参考意义的部分并不存在。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 226}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这就会很令人愤怒，因为你的贡献等于零，你无形中把自己的责任取消了。", "char_start": 227, "char_end": 260}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你作为团队成员，只能上交你解决了但没解决掉的问题，而不是把落到你头上的问题原汁原味、全须全尾的丢给别人去帮你解决。", "char_start": 261, "char_end": 318}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果你的问题转交给别人的时候没有附上任何来自你自己的研究、尝试和调查痕迹，你就要回答一个更根本的伦理问题——请问你的责任在哪？", "char_start": 319, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你承担了什么？", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 390}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你以为这还是在学校？是你出钱、国家替你补贴，在雇佣老师给你解决问题吗？", "char_start": 391, "char_end": 426}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你是团队成员，你是按照“将积极为解决团队的共同问题承担一份责任、从而在团队的共同收获中分得一份”的条款进来的。", "char_start": 427, "char_end": 482}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "每个人对自己手上遇到的问题都是无可推卸的第一责任人，问题过了你的手、流经了你这个节点，必须比没有流经你这个节点之前附上更多的参考信息和适当的预处理。", "char_start": 483, "char_end": 557}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "比如顾客抱怨一个产品问题，提出要求，你是接线员，你手册上没有对应的处理方案。", "char_start": 558, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "问题到你这个节点，原始的状态是一段电话录音。从你手里流向你的主管，你主管拿到的就不能还是这一段原始录音，还应该有你的概述、你查阅过的过往类似案例、你自己预先给客户做的铺垫性答复等等等等来自你的、新产生的数据。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 701}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "你确实最后没能解决这个问题，以至于要向上提问，但是你交上来的问题和你接到手的问题之间必须要多出一块你所生产的内容。", "char_start": 702, "char_end": 759}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "上司真正关心的不仅仅是“问题本身的解决”这种事务性的收益，还在关心你作为团队成员、作为业务节点的有效性。", "char_start": 760, "char_end": 812}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "ta要关心你这个节点所做的探索为什么没能解决这个问题，必须要检查“你这个节点的产出”这个原始资料，看你是哪方面技能不足还是有什么信息权限没开放给你。", "char_start": 813, "char_end": 887}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "只要有这个纪录，这类改进起码就有一个努力的起点。", "char_start": 888, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "结果你可倒好，问题原样转交上级处理，你的附加信息生产都不是质量如何的问题，而是产量都为0。想改善团队结构、成员技能都没有地方可以下手。", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "请问，团队为什么要多花钱添加一个可靠性还不如语音信箱的“问题转发器”？是现代科技还没实现这个功能吗？", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 1031}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "又或者你产量不为零，但是质量和产量根本和一个身体健康、神志清楚、能说会算的人类应有的质量和产量不相称，那也同样会让人觉得你的工作伦理和职业道德有问题。", "char_start": 1032, "char_end": 1107}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对方不是因为你提问而发怒。", "char_start": 1108, "char_end": 1121}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "而是因为透过你转发的问题，察觉到了“事不关己”的态度而发怒。", "char_start": 1122, "char_end": 1152}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为这是对自己加入团队的基本承诺的背叛，是一种公然的欺骗。", "char_start": 1153, "char_end": 1182}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "是你自己削尖脑袋要挤进来做事的，挤进来了你却当“问题转发器”，你还要嘟囔“是你让我不懂就问的”来给自己的袖手旁观“鸣冤”，换了是你，你怒不怒？", "char_start": 1183, "char_end": 1254}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "你的思考痕迹、你的信息产出、你对问题的改善性努力在哪？这是你领取报酬和福利、占用其他团队成员精力、挤占那些没能坐上你的位置的竞争对手的原因，是你的存在价值。", "char_start": 1255, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "说得再赤裸一点，是你让我花钱，说要卖给我的货。", "char_start": 1334, "char_end": 1357}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我的钱付了，你的货在哪？", "char_start": 1358, "char_end": 1370}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "你还奇怪我为什么发火？", "char_start": 1371, "char_end": 1382}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "你还要嘟囔“是我叫你问的”？", "char_start": 1383, "char_end": 1397}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 32}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：领导鼓励我「不懂就问」，但当我真正提问时他却显得不耐烦，我该如何处理这种矛盾？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031"], "summary": "围绕“问得不耐烦”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“说“不懂就问”，就给了发问权。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "说“不懂就问”，就给了发问权。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5d0a775e-f2e9-5c56-b3ac-f3519ecd0146", "source_ordinal": 1430, "reading_ordinal": 2627, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "madness", "published_at": "2024-07-29T07:28:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/662675878/answer/3576718420"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个非常疯狂的策略。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "奥运开幕式要花很多钱，这个是肯定的。而开幕式回本的主要手段是卖转播权。而转播权值不值钱，和开幕式是否有泄密有很大的关系。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果你不承诺保密，还没播就泄露出各种彩排细节，根据转播合同你很可能要赔很多钱——因为你的客户赔了大钱。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 124}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这就是为什么历来奥运会开幕式都会选一个大体育场来搞。就是因为体育场可以提供必要的保密条件，可以无数次的安全彩排，即保证现场效果可靠精彩，又不会发生泄密。", "char_start": 125, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "对照着看，你就知道巴黎这次选择塞纳河、埃菲尔铁塔和卢浮宫是多么疯狂。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这都是不可能拿来封闭彩排的场所，游人如织、人人举着相机。而一场投资上十亿欧元的超大型活动居然连一次全场彩排都不做，这是一种什么样的疯狂？", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这么说吧，假如印度今天突然决定拿一次都没试过的飞船直接载人航天，其实风险都比这小。因为飞船好歹出意外都是机械风险，可不是每一个环节都靠“充满浪漫精神的法国人”在执行。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这么搞，可能出问题的环节非常的多，最常见的就是各种意料之外的故障、意外卡住进程。既然没有大彩排，就意味着机位调度、镜头切换、字幕解说……全都是第一轮硬上，全靠导演现场灵活机变。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "本来预定几点镜头给总统，几点火炬越过哪个屋顶，几点正好让哪两个元素同框……一旦现场有点意外，时间错过了，就要临时调整防止开天窗、防止影响最关键的时程。", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果你仔细观察，会发现这次转播用了大量的机动机位。甚至都不是用的摇臂、滑轨，而是摄影师硬扛着拍，在旁边的船上跟拍，用无人机、直升机拍。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 622}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "这就是因为没有彩排，现场可能出现的意外太多，所以被迫用大量的机动性来准备应付意外。结果就是这次开幕的转播是画面最摇晃的一次。", "char_start": 623, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "尤其是，这种大开放场地，起雾、下雨、起风，根本不受控制，而要为这种场地做备案几乎不现实。", "char_start": 687, "char_end": 731}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "难不成还能给整条塞纳河加盖子不成？一旦下雨，全靠硬捱。那位近百岁坐着轮椅的火炬手淋着这么大的雨来参加，着实是为了祖国在搏命了。", "char_start": 732, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "而且还有更令人后怕的东西被人忽视了——这样一个庆典进程，简直是恐怖袭击的黄金机会。这安保根本就没法做。谁知道哪个阳台上不会飞出一发火箭弹或者无人机给以色列队的船来个天女散花？天知道哪个屋顶不会发出几发大烟花，来个“从海洋到河流”的大标语？如此开放的空间和混乱的人流，拿什么管控？", "char_start": 797, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "所以说这个开幕式只要没死到三个人以上其实组委会都可以开表彰大会了。", "char_start": 938, "char_end": 971}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "的确，直接用上塞纳河、西岱岛、卢浮宫，埃菲尔铁塔，再没有比这更法国、更巴黎的方案了。而要用这个方案，就是要眼睁睁的去冒这么多根本无法管控的风险。", "char_start": 972, "char_end": 1044}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这就是豪赌。", "char_start": 1045, "char_end": 1051}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你甚至可以怀疑，之所以内容如此激烈、出位，就是因为导演组已经赌红了眼。反正已经赌了命，为啥还要限制赌注？干脆赌穿、赌透。", "char_start": 1052, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这也算见证历史了，知道珍惜吧。有这么大的胆子还能真干得出来的可真不多。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1148}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "至少张艺谋多半是没这胆子的。", "char_start": 1149, "char_end": 1163}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价巴黎奥运会运动员在塞纳河上乘坐游船入场的方式？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020"], "summary": "围绕“madness”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个非常疯狂的策略。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个非常疯狂的策略。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "48a28463-60f3-56d1-98b1-6564b2367308", "source_ordinal": 1429, "reading_ordinal": 2628, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "情义有价", "published_at": "2024-07-29T08:22:05+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/957a79e84d4011efa2fd52540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "要让对方知道这礼物的价值，但这个方法不是“说一个价格”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一份礼物的价值分几部分。", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）原材料的市场价格。这部分对方可以自己查到，你不要讲价格，你只讲型号、规格、分量，让对方有充分的机会自己去查。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "比如你送了一条自己亲自做的火腿，用的猪肉很特别，那么你很有必要告诉对方这是什么产地什么类型什么品质的猪。这猪肉什么价你别说，让人家自己去查。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一来，防止你说的价跟人家查到的不一样，那就反而要生出事端。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 199}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "二来，这就显得对对方正确估计价值的能力的不信任，这实际上是一种不尊重。", "char_start": 200, "char_end": 235}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）这份礼物里你自己花费的人工。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "举个例子，你寻了一块沉香自己雕了一块牌子给ta。沉香的来源品质你说了，你还有必要说一说你这份做工花了你多少小时。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 310}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "至于你每小时折合多少钱，这个你不要说，要让对方自己掂量、估价。", "char_start": 311, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "3）策划这件事的心力。", "char_start": 344, "char_end": 355}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "也就是你思考、物色和求取这些东西的、制造和生产之外的付出。例如为了淘到这块材料，你下了什么功夫，你怎么想到要送ta这个，等等等等。", "char_start": 356, "char_end": 421}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这份创意和思考是有价值的，你要给对方足够的依据去评估。", "char_start": 422, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这三方面的价值你都要说明，但始终遵循一个原则——给你正确估价的理想信息条件和充分自由，绝不直接告知对方你自己的估价。", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 509}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "因为对方对这份礼物的估价本身是你需要经过这件事获得的关键数据，甚至可以说是“礼尚往来”作为沟通手段最关键的目的之一。", "char_start": 510, "char_end": 568}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这其实是一个无声的试题——既不要难度过高，导致丧失测量对方能力和意愿的效能，又不要过于简单，导致如同开卷考试，题都帮你答好了，你只需要填名字交卷。那样考出来的分数有何指导意义？", "char_start": 570, "char_end": 658}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "有人会问，“这样送礼物会不会给人压力太大了”？", "char_start": 660, "char_end": 683}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "其实本来送礼物压力就是这么大，假装“你不要有压力”没用。你想压力小，你就不要送综合价值那么高的重礼不就行了？不要送那些你花了一百多个小时精心筹划的礼物不就好了？", "char_start": 684, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你送一些本身市场价格就不高、自己投入时间、创意也不多的礼物，压力就小了。小到一定程度——即微不足道的程度——也就是你送这个礼物仅仅是因为不送一下会显得无礼而已，那你当然没必要再去告诉别人什么价值，期待测量对方的估价。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 873}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "只要你送了重礼、用了心的礼物，你必然给了对方这个压力，你再去纠结“是不是压力太大”是没有意义的，你最佳的策略必然是一不做二不休，顺势达到最大限度的目的。", "char_start": 874, "char_end": 950}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而这其中拿到“对方对你的价值的真实估计”这个反馈是至关重要的结果。", "char_start": 951, "char_end": 984}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这就跟马斯克炸掉一艘星舰就是为了那点数据一样。", "char_start": 985, "char_end": 1008}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你不要搞得星舰也炸了，火星没上也罢了，就连数据都没拿到一个，结果天天写日记劝自己“心态平和”，这叫什么鬼？", "char_start": 1009, "char_end": 1062}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "所以，首先不推荐随便送重礼。不是要结拜、要拜师、要投效、要祝寿、要定情、要会盟、要赐名……这些和天地君亲师这类重大关系有关的礼仪相关，不建议你随便送这类重礼。", "char_start": 1063, "char_end": 1142}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "但是一旦送了重礼，拿到这个反馈数据就是最低目标。", "char_start": 1143, "char_end": 1167}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "因为这个反馈数据直接关系到这份礼物所指向的关系的成色。", "char_start": 1168, "char_end": 1195}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "所以你要采取一切手段保证测量准确且有效，足以指导你后续的决策而不会让你犹豫怀疑。", "char_start": 1196, "char_end": 1236}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "如果你不给任何提示，人家给你的反应不如你预期，你就会陷入这种犹豫和怀疑。——对方到底是不知道这份礼物的分量呢，还是知道但不重视？", "char_start": 1238, "char_end": 1302}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "要对方自己品鉴出这是什么品质的猪肉、这是什么等级的田黄石，未免过于强人所难了。你不给这些基础数据，出来的测试结果根本不可信，这岂不是白干了吗？", "char_start": 1303, "char_end": 1374}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你给了足够的条件去做这个估价，你就可以极大的排除掉结果没有解读意义的可能。", "char_start": 1375, "char_end": 1412}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "那么接下来的要么是对方给你的反馈不如你的预期，要么ta不重视到自己不去计算，要么ta无能到算不准，要么ta对你的时间、创意的估价很低，要么就是真的算完之后觉得对ta没有价值。", "char_start": 1413, "char_end": 1500}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "无论是哪个，你要做后续的决定都会少很多纠结。", "char_start": 1501, "char_end": 1523}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "注意，做这个统计还有另一个重要的意义，就是让你自己对自己的礼物有一个正确的估价，以免你自己产生情义无价的错觉。", "char_start": 1524, "char_end": 1579}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "是的，你是花了二十多个小时来干这事，但你老人家的时薪客观上也就80块一小时，你这也就是原料成本价再加1600块，虽然不算便宜，但也是有价的。", "char_start": 1580, "char_end": 1650}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你别搞得人家不以身相许你就觉得亏了。", "char_start": 1651, "char_end": 1669}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "除此之外，讲这些东西还有一个很重要的意义，那就是一份重礼真正的意义并不简单的在于它好吃好用，还在于它背后的故事。", "char_start": 1671, "char_end": 1727}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "它是从何处缘起，又是如何产生，这个故事本身就是它最重要的价值之一。即使不为这个考量，这也是礼物本身应该包含的必要部分，不给，这个礼物本身就缺了一块。", "char_start": 1728, "char_end": 1802}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 43}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：送礼物要说价格吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036"], "summary": "围绕“情义有价”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“要让对方知道这礼物的价值，但这个方法不是“说一个价格”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "要让对方知道这礼物的价值，但这个方法不是“说一个价格”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ed93a692-b4e3-56ae-9e87-6d7cd0e55066", "source_ordinal": 1428, "reading_ordinal": 2629, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "智慧的价值", "published_at": "2024-07-29T09:59:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/656110527/answer/3576854263"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你这个想法可完全搞错了方向。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "头脑极其清醒、思想极其全面、思维极其广阔，其效用根本不是用来“避免各种决策错误”，而是为了“让错误变得最有价值”。", "char_start": 15, "char_end": 72}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "智慧的根本价值，不是为了避免错误，而是为了避免浪费错误。", "char_start": 73, "char_end": 101}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这体现在以下几点：", "char_start": 102, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "1）它可以避免你把有限的人生浪费在没有新意的、缺少价值的低级错误上。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 146}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "只有你避免了低级错误，你才有更大的机会去犯高级的错误，犯那些连失败的经验都可以被拿去卖钱的错误。", "char_start": 147, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "2）它可以避免犯莫名其妙的错误。", "char_start": 197, "char_end": 213}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "一个智慧的人失败了，其失败的原因往往可以做更精确的定位，形成下一次改进的基础。", "char_start": 214, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "而一个愚蠢的人失败了，往往是原本的计划就漏洞百出、任何一个环节都有可能是原因，甚至连大概指出错误在东南西北哪个方向都困难，以至于根本没有可总结的教训，下次再来没有任何依据可以认为成功概率会提高。", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "所谓的“成功”，其实并不在于在疯狂的赌博中压中了概率，那不叫成功的人生。", "char_start": 353, "char_end": 389}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "只能叫侥幸的人生。", "char_start": 390, "char_end": 399}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "侥幸的人生其实是不幸的，因为一来它不可避免的制造傲慢心，二来它带来难以排除的德不配位、朝不保夕的恐慌。这两者都是巨大的诅咒，足以很快的没收你短暂的狂喜。", "char_start": 400, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "成功的人生，是去挑战优质的错误的人生。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 496}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "也就是那些“就算失败，光是卖失败的确切记录都能回本”的人生，那些“哪怕牺牲都算烈士”的人生。", "char_start": 497, "char_end": 543}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "因为它直接战胜了失败本身，根本无败可言。", "char_start": 544, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而这样的人生，必须要从尽可能排除低级的、即使再验证了也只是多余的重复案例的错误开始。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 607}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "智慧不是为了避免犯错，智慧是为了犯更好的错误。", "char_start": 608, "char_end": 631}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "成功不但不是不犯错，反而恰恰是去犯除了你没人有资格、有机会、有运气去犯的错误。", "char_start": 632, "char_end": 671}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "不搞清楚这一点，追求“成功”就是在追求侥幸，追求侥幸必然带来的恐惧。你的“成功”只会受限于你能承受的最大恐惧，而且你最后必定要烧香拜佛安抚你德不配位的焦虑。如果你不“见好就收”，往往其身既死、其名亦亡，化为乌有。", "char_start": 672, "char_end": 778}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "搞明白这一点，你才有真正成功的希望。你有多成功根本不受限于你的才能，只取决于历史对你的选择。", "char_start": 779, "char_end": 825}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "并且，你的功业必受纪念。", "char_start": 826, "char_end": 838}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 23}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：头脑极其清醒思想极其全面思维极其广阔的人可以最大限度的避免各种决策失误吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“智慧的价值”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你这个想法可完全搞错了方向。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你这个想法可完全搞错了方向。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 14, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "33ba4dd9-d4ff-5c63-982c-2a94bc19d3cc", "source_ordinal": 1427, "reading_ordinal": 2630, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "不受采访", "published_at": "2024-07-29T18:55:12+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/45055496/answer/3577441320"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这就是为啥你不该随便接受记者采访。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "以前的人比较天真，会觉得这是一个扩大知名度的好机会，殊不知一旦接受了采访，就等于人为刀俎，我为鱼肉，太阿倒持，授人以柄。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果你是没名没份的，为了出名搏命那也罢了。如果你是生活在信息不发达的时代，那也罢了。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果你本来就功成名就，而且生活在现代，你要对公众说话，就一定要自己直接说。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这样没人在提问中给你挖坑，也没人去诱导谈话的方向，也没有人在转述时“删繁就简”，或者“寻找合适的阅读群体”“等待恰当的发布时机”。说完了无论是被误解还是被咒骂，好歹是自己直接说的话，自己直接负责。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "就算要接受采访，绝不能只看对方有个什么报的头衔，甚至有个记者之类的名号就乱冲动。必须这个人有长久的新闻道德的可靠记录再谈。或者换一个视角，如果你手里有什么一旦对手瞎搞你就能捏住ta的脖子让ta当众自己吞下去的手段也勉强可以。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "一旦接受采访，这些事就都由不得你了，事后你再后悔、纠结都没有意义了，这跟在一张空白合同上先签字盖章没啥区别，谁要你胆肥敢签呢？", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这是生活常识，不是最近一两年才需要树立的新认识。记者这个职业天生就是这样的属性，自从有媒体以来一直就是这样。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 490}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你们自己要记牢，不要将来人生上升到一定高度时脑袋发晕，过于天真，误以为这都是天赐良缘。", "char_start": 491, "char_end": 534}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 9}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0383"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何评价贾平凹在采访中说「如果村子不买媳妇，这个村子就消亡了」「被拐卖要怪女人太好骗」这种话？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“不受采访”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这就是为啥你不该随便接受记者采访。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这就是为啥你不该随便接受记者采访。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
